{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610710/extras/588b1304d5876edeaf17d3f6619f4d71.avif?t=1768119027\" width=600 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family has been poor for generations, and now you have grown into manhood with one goal: free them from poverty and struggle. Take control of Jack as you begin a journey with one goal...and it becomes something very different that shakes your family to its foundations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration RPG with over 150 items to use and equip, random loot and over 25 monsters to fight. Each game is different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom designed, detailed parallax maps with immersive sound and music design throughout. Over 4-6 hours of gameplay on average.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 skills to learn, each with different effects and advantages. No 'magic' used here, this is a strictly practical, real-world based RPG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 quests to complete, many important to progress in the game, with on-screen tracker. Strong writing and narrative twists used to propel the story forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OTB based combat increases strategy needed to win fights consistently.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of pirates, treasure and adventure today with Sea Of Secrets!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/610710?t=1768119027","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/610710?t=1768119027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610710/0e017004bfa2da402b0715930a18a36d15ee5ab0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768119027","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610710/0e017004bfa2da402b0715930a18a36d15ee5ab0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768119027","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610710/extras/588b1304d5876edeaf17d3f6619f4d71.avif?t=1768119027\" width=600 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family has been poor for generations, and now you have grown into manhood with one goal: free them from poverty and struggle. Take control of Jack as you begin a journey with one goal...and it becomes something very different that shakes your family to its foundations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration RPG with over 150 items to use and equip, random loot and over 25 monsters to fight. Each game is different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom designed, detailed parallax maps with immersive sound and music design throughout. Over 4-6 hours of gameplay on average.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 skills to learn, each with different effects and advantages. No 'magic' used here, this is a strictly practical, real-world based RPG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 quests to complete, many important to progress in the game, with on-screen tracker. Strong writing and narrative twists used to propel the story forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OTB based combat increases strategy needed to win fights consistently.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of pirates, treasure and adventure today with Sea Of Secrets!</p>","developers":["SimProse Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610710/2b4fddc4b310a145afccd51505da4a3d51f11bab/header.jpg?t=1768119027","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/610710/751321087/d2ba0fe02408d667d802f656efcf22a9f6e0ed4d/1750383355/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750446365","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/610710/751321087/d2ba0fe02408d667d802f656efcf22a9f6e0ed4d/1750383355/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750446365","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/610710/751321087/d2ba0fe02408d667d802f656efcf22a9f6e0ed4d/1750383355/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750446365","id":257159029,"name":"Main Game","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257159029/438a14a955ac13721dfd27677c2bd05fcef5604f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750446365"}],"name":"Sea Of Secrets","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Sea Of Secrets - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99</span> $0.49 USD","packageid":163068,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-90% ","price_in_